 "pages": {
  "default/32121.htm": {
   "file": "default/32121.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: The stone pillar looks like it was erected a long time ago. The top is worn and chipped in places, but the ancient letters on its face seem to be relatively bright and clear.",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Quest",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Quest",
     "kind": "quest-menu",
     "to": "@questlist"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-01.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: The Pillar of Wisdom looks like any other monument, but there is a feeling of some kind of hidden power. Perhaps it is one of the pillars created by Shilen... Since you don't know how to communicate with the pillar, perhaps it would be better to return after learning how to do so.",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1|2|3|4|5|6"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-02.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: (Staring closely at the Pillar of Wisdom, the delicate letters on its face seem to move rhythmically. Given its location, this must be Chuta Kaimu....)",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 7; st.get(\"Memo\") == null"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Touching the pillar seems to cause it to react. Try to communicate with it.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1 32121-03.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1",
     "event": "32121-03.html",
     "quest": 125,
     "to": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-03.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-09.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-09.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: Whoo...Who has awakened me from this silence you small and strange-looking creature has done it I have never seen such a strange-looking creature since Shilen gave me life...",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 7; !st.get(\"Memo\") == null; switch(st.getInt(\"Memo\")) case 1"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "The speech is so fast that it's impossible to understand. Ask it to say it again slowly.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1 32121-10.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1",
     "event": "32121-10.html",
     "quest": 125,
     "to": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-10.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-19.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-19.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: Your identity is confirmed! I sense a signal from my brother Balu Kaimu, who has also been awakened from his long slumber. He shares wisdom with me that confirms you are indeed the outsider fated to save this island.",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 7; !st.get(\"Memo\") == null; switch(st.getInt(\"Memo\")) case 2"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "It seems that your identity has been confirmed.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1 32121-12.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1",
     "event": "32121-12.html",
     "quest": 125,
     "to": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-12.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-20.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-20.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: The item you have brought here is surely a fragment of the weapon wielded by ancient Elrokian warriors to subjugate and control the vicious dinosaurs of the island. Blessed by Shilen herself, it was a powerful force for order in their hands.",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 7; !st.get(\"Memo\") == null; switch(st.getInt(\"Memo\")) case 3"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Show Chuta Kaimu the relic youy received from Mushika.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1 32121-17.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1",
     "event": "32121-17.html",
     "quest": 125,
     "to": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-17.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-21.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32121-21.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: Take this written wisdom to the leader of the Elroki tribe. He too has an important role to play in averting this coming doom and will aid you in your quest.",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 8"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-1.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-1.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: This is the Pillar of Wisdom known as Chuta Kaimu! Communication is not possible at the moment -- something is lacking.",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1|2|3|4|5|6|7"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-2.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-2.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: To communicate with Chuta Kaimu, place your hands on the pillar and think about the question you wish to ask. As you do so, the ancient letters moving rhythmically on the face of the pillar seem to gather around your hands. You feel a sensation of warmth.",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 8"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Chuta Kaimu has recognized you.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32121-3.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32121-3.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-3.html",
     "effect": "cond:9"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-3e.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-3e.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: Chuta Kaimu awaits your reaction after it has finished searching for Gazkh.and.abnormal.phenomena.",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 9"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "It seems like its search has been completed. Try to communicate with it.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32121-3a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32121-3a.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-3a.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-4e.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-4e.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: The melody sounds similar to the one that Balu Kaimu sang. Perhaps it is the next verse of the song; given its similarity to the other melody, it should be easy to memorize.",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 10"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Listen to the melody.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32121-4a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32121-4a.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-4a.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-5a.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-5a.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Chuta Kaimu: This is all the wisdom I can share with you. Follow this road to the Warrior's Grave at the southwest end. Once there, pray for his soul and you may receive what you require. If necessary, place the Gazkh fragment on the Warrior's Grave.",
   "header": "Chuta Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Listen to the third verse of the melody in order to confirm.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32121-5b.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32121-5b.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32121-5b.html"
    }
   ]
  },
